From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:17:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "DVDMessageQueue: stop the queue at its time size as
 well"

A queue full by time makes VideoPlayer start the clock on audio alone
after a seek far before the next keyframe. The picture from before the
seek then stays up until the clock reaches that keyframe, about 5 s on
a 10 s GOP. CE drops the change.
---
 xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDMessageQueue.h | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDMessageQueue.h b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDMessageQueue.h
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDMessageQueue.h
+++ b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDMessageQueue.h
@@ -0,7 +0,7 @@
   void WaitUntilEmpty();
 
   // non messagequeue related functions
-  bool IsFull() const { return GetLevel() == 100; }
+  bool IsFull() const { return GetLevel(true) == 100; }
 
   /*!
    * \brief Get the current queue level.
